blespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Put potatoes and bay leaves in a large [[Cookbook:Dutch Oven|Dutch oven]]. Put enough water to cover and bring to a rolling [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]]. Cook for 15 minutes or until tender.\n#Drain and shock. Drain again and discard bay leaves. Pat dry with [[Cookbook:Paper Towel|paper towels]].\n#[[Cookbook:Whisk|Whisk]] together oil and remaining ingredients. Add potatoes and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] to coat.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in a 425°F [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] for 10 minutes or until lightly to deeply brown. Serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Roasted recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Roasted Redskin Potatoes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 ½ pounds red-skinned potatoes, halved","sourceText":"1 ½ pounds red-skinned potatoes, halved","amountText":"1 ½ pounds red-skinned potatoes, halved","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 tbsp olive oil","sourceText":"3 tbsp olive oil","amountText":"3 tbsp olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 bay leaves","sourceText":"3 bay leaves","amountText":"3 bay leaves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tsp dried rosemary","sourceText":"2 tsp dried rosemary","amountText":"2 tsp dried rosemary","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 tsp dried thyme","sourceText":"2 tsp dried thyme","amountText":"2 tsp dried thyme","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tsp salt","sourceText":"1 tsp salt","amountText":"1 tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 tsp black pepper","sourceText":"1 tsp black pepper","amountText":"1 tsp black 